	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_04_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_04_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_04_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_3_02_forward@@"


#!}
#### 3_04 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene01"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you'll face a variety of different turns to help you get used to driving with a trailer. Stay focused, adjust your speed to each situation, and make full use of the space available on the training course."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene02"
	val[]: "The first turn is a dogleg turn - two turns in one. You'll have to set up for a left turn, but transition to a right turn in the middle of the manoeuvre."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene03"
	val[]: "This next turn crosses you over to the other side of the median. It's not particularly difficult but you will need to watch that you leave enough space for your trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene04"
	val[]: "Next you'll have to negotiate a tight slalom through the concrete barriers. Go slow and use your mirrors, and make sure you swing wide enough so your trailer can clear the barriers."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene05"
	val[]: "At this point, you'll enter another slalom complimented by extra cones at the apex of each curve. <br>Be sure not to hit any of them!"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene06"
	val[]: "Next are a couple of easy corners on your way to the roundabout."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene07"
	val[]: "Use the straight section to prepare for entering the roundabout. Stay to the outside before you enter it."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene08"
	val[]: "Enter the roundabout and watch the placement of your trailer. It will track differently once you are inside the roundabout compared to how you entered."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene09"
	val[]: "Exit the roundabout and drive on to the next set of turns."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene10"
	val[]: "REMOVE THIS CUTSCENE"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene11"
	val[]: "The turn here is extremely sharp. Take it slow and use the space around you smartly. Be mindful of the trailer's tail swing as well."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene12"
	val[]: "As you drive through the next few turns, remember to try and set yourself up for the next turn as you exit the previous one."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene13"
	val[]: "Don't rush the final corner. It looks easy, but there is less room to manoeuvre than there appears to be."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_cutscene14"
	val[]: "Stop in the designated area, secure the truck and shut down the engine."


#### 3_04 Driving Instructions


	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_forward"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Accelerate towards the first turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check1"
	val[]: "The first turn is an easy dogleg turn.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make the turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check2"
	val[]: "REMOVE THIS CHECK"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check3"
	val[]: "Ahead the course continues on the left of the median.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make your way through the crossover. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check4"
	val[]: "Manoeuvre through the barriers and remember to watch your trailer.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive through the slalom. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check5"
	val[]: "This slalom is more straightforward, but the traffic cones make it significantly tighter.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive through the slalom and avoid hitting any cones. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check6"
	val[]: "Ahead are a couple of easy corners, you'll still need to set up properly to keep your trailer away from the inside barriers.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make the turns. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check7"
	val[]: "You're approaching a roundabout. Remember to leave enough room for your trailer not only when entering and exiting, but also as you drive through it.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive through the roundabout. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check8"
	val[]: "There's short straight section ahead of you, you can pick up a bit of speed if you like.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue driving. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check9"
	val[]: "The turn here is extremely sharp. Go slow, use all the space available to you, and keep your trailer's tail swing in mind. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive through the sharp turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check10"
	val[]: "The last few turns are straight forward. Remember to keep your trailer in mind.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue on. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_check11"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue towards the final parking spot. </font>"
#!{

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_02_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_04_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

#!}
#@}

