	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_06_title"
	val[]: "Στάθμευση σε Στενό Χώρο"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_06_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll park in a narrow space.<br><br>You'll have to manoeuvre the trailer to line up straight with an offset parking spot."

#### 3_06 goal


	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_06_check1"
	val[]: "Manoeuvring into Place"
