#### 3_06 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Parking while driving forwards, or 'nosing in', is pretty easy as far as parking manoeuvres are concerned. <br>You will still need to compensate for the offset tracking of the trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_cutscene02"
	val[]: "You'll have to drive past the point where you would normally turn the tractor by itself. This will allow you to get the trailer lined up more effectively."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_cutscene03"
	val[]: "As you approach the parking spot, turn in to get the tractor in front of the trailer. Get lined up and proceed into the spot. <br>Stop, park, and secure the truck and shut down the engine."

#### 3_06 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_start"
	val[]: "Ahead of you there is a parking spot that you'll need to drive to and park inside of.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare to set off. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_forward"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start driving and turn towards the parking spot.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_check1"
	val[]: "Drive past the parking spot to get your trailer lined up with the marked area, then bring the tractor into the spot and straighten out.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Park in the designated area.  </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_stop"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Stop in the designated area.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_end"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Secure the truck and shut down the engine.</font>"
#@}

# Scenario 3_07 formatting
