#### 3_11 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Roundabouts are a little more complicated to negotiate with doubles than a single trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene2"
	val[]: "You must drive in far enough that both trailers will enter successfully, but you must then drive to the outside to keep the trailers away from the centre."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene3"
	val[]: "It's okay if both trailers won't fit in one lane - in fact, it may even be better to straddle both lanes so that an optimistic motorist doesn't try to pass you."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Drive to the far side of your exit lane to again ensure both trailers are clear of any potential collisions."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Continue to the second roundabout."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene6"
	val[]: "This roundabout only has one lane, so take your time and be precise."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene7"
	val[]: "Use all of the room available to you - cutting corners here will only make things more difficult."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene8"
	val[]: "Take the exit and proceed towards the parking area."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_3_11_cutscene9"
	val[]: "Park and secure the truck."

#### 3_11 infinite Fun Driving Instructions

