#!}
#### correcting_straight_backing - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Someone has attempted to reverse this combination into the parking spot and had a little trouble. Now it's up to you to fix it!"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene02"
	val[]: "The first step is to pull forward and get everything straightened out into something we can work with. It's crucial to have the rear trailer pointed where you want it to go."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene03"
	val[]: "In this case, we've chosen to go more towards the driver side. This will give us a better view of what we are doing as we reverse, and allow us to work from one side. <br><br>Remember, you are steering the rear trailer with the lead, so don't focus on the tractor so much."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene04"
	val[]: "The combination is more or less where we need it, but let's pull forward again to centre it properly."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene05"
	val[]: "From here, we will very delicately reverse into place, making sure the rear trailer stays perfectly on track."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene06"
	val[]: "Now we can line up the lead trailer and the tractor itself."

#### correcting_Straight_Backing Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_forward"
	val[]: "Pull forward and straighten everything up. <br><br>Once you are satisfied, reverse into the designated area."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_check1"
	val[]: "Κάνε όπισθεν προς την προκαθορισμένη περιοχή."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_end"
	val[]: "Secure the vehicle and shut off the engine."

#@}


#+ Book 3 Scenario backing_90_tight
#@{

#### backing_90_tight common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_backing_90_tight_title"
	val[]: "90-degree Backing"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_backing_90_tight_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you'll use a 90-degree backing manoeuvre to park in a row of other trucks."

#### backing_90_tight goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_check1"
	val[]: "Αναστροφή"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_check2"
	val[]: "Εκκινώντας"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_check3"
	val[]: "Όπισθεν"

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_forward@@"
#!}
#### backing_90_tight msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Reversing to the side is easier with doubles, as you will have a clearer vantage point out of the side window of everything going on."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene2"
	val[]: "First, drive forward and make a U-turn at the end of the row. This will allow you to set up from the sight side, allowing you to see things better out of your driver's side window."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene3"
	val[]: "You may choose to set up the trailers however you see fit, perhaps with the rear trailer already pointing towards the spot. In this case, we will start from a straight position. <br><br>Remember to keep it simple - steer the rear trailer with the lead."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Steer the lead trailer slightly away from the parking spot, and the rear trailer will start to point towards the spot. From there, adjust the angle between the lead and rear trailer to maintain a nice, smooth arch into the parking spot."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Remember, if the rear trailer is coming in too tight, then you must straighten the angle of the combination some. If it is going too wide, then get the angle sharper."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Adjustments you make with the tractor have half as much affect on the rear trailer as they do on the lead, so don't be afraid to really work your tractor."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene7"
	val[]: "At this point, you must start planning ahead. You must also get the lead trailer into the spot as well, so start a plan to get it straight in front of the rear."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene8"
	val[]: "It is very rare to get the trailers in on the first attempt. In this case, we waited too long to straighten up the lead, and now the rear is drifting off path. <br><br>No problem, pull forward and try again."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene9"
	val[]: "Really work that wheel, and get those trailers where you want them. You can pull forward as many times as you need to until you are satisfied."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene10"
	val[]: "And just like that, we've successfully parked doubles."

#### backing_90_tight Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_forward"
	val[]: "Drive forward to the end of the lot and turn around."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_check1"
	val[]: "Remember to make a wide turn."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_check2"
	val[]: "Continue forward until you feel you have adequate room to manoeuvre, then start reversing."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_check3"
	val[]: "Reverse into the parking spot if you feel you have adequate room to manoeuvre."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#@}


