	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_correcting_90_title"
	val[]: "90-degree Backing Correction"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_correcting_90_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you're tasked with finishing a 90-degree backing manoeuvre that somebody else gave up on."

#### correcting_90 goal

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_correcting_90_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"

