#### parallel common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_parallel_title"
	val[]: "Parallel Parking"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_parallel_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll parallel park a set of doubles on a roadway."

#### parallel goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_parallel_check1"
	val[]: "Reversing"

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_parallel_stop"
